# card is in the graveyard and is a creature card that would match (CR 400.7): it is not one of the candidates, leaving
# Bot2's Entombed Llanowar Elves as the only one. Copying it makes him a 1/1, not the 4/3 he is printed as (CR 707.2, 707.9a).

